&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear Salesforce and Clari hygiene including use case, MEDDPICC, revenue forecasts, and account notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with a customer first mindset and focus on business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of closing sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in big data, Cloud, or SaaS sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to quickly learn new technologies and value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience exceeding sales KPIs and quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success closing new accounts while working existing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
