&lt;li&gt;Tuesday - Saturday 11:00pm-8:00am ET&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Chicago, IL, Denver, CO, and Westlake, TX offices, with in-person attendance expected 5 days per week during the 10-week onboarding period. After onboarding, in-person attendance is expected 3 days every other week, with no required in-office days during the alternating weeks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
