&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools like Excel, Smartsheet, Confluence, Salesforce, Tableau, or PowerBI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis skills in Excel, SQL, and/or Business Intelligence tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a high-volume consumer product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of root cause analysis and Six Sigma or other lean manufacturing concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex projects and assessing schedule dependencies, risks, and conflicts&lt;/li&gt;
