&lt;li&gt;Operate forklifts, scissor lifts, and boom lifts when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open, track, and resolve electronic work tickets on SpaceX’s custom work order system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to proper safety guidelines at all times&lt;/li&gt;
