&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Airtable is the no-code app platform that empowers people closest to the work to accelerate their most critical business processes. More than 500,000 organizations, including 80% of the Fortune 100, rely on Airtable to transform how work gets done.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join Airtable as a Professional Services Engineer and play a pivotal role in delivering complex, high-impact solutions for our largest enterprise customers. You’ll work at the intersection of technology and customer success, supporting technical integrations, migrations, and advanced AI deployments. This is a unique opportunity to collaborate with top-tier clients, enable partners, and shape the future of how organizations use Airtable to drive business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;mb1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical components of post-sales services engagements, including integrations, competitor migrations, custom interfaces, and SSO/SCIM implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support complex AI deployments and leverage AI tools to accelerate project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable internal and partner teams on technical concepts, features, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with sales and solution architects in pre-sales conversations to secure technical wins with key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer business outcomes, balancing utilization, project delivery efficiency, and striving for strong CSAT results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as part of project delivery teams and co-deliver with partner teams for enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex-auto line-height-4 py1 px1 overflow-auto focus-visible&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;width-full focus-visible&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;aiMarkdownRichText width-full pre-wrap break-word&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;mb1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in post-sales SaaS implementation or customer success, ideally with enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in web development (React), scripting (Python, JavaScript, etc.), and/or SSO/SCIM implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with AI tools (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor) or eager to learn and apply new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative and customer-facing skills, with a track record of delivering successful technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to learn new skills independently and a curiosity to explore emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player with experience in project delivery or partner co-delivery environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
