&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;But powerful stories need proof. That’s where you come in.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You’ll transform data into direction. Tracking performance across channels, identifying what resonates most with candidates, and building the reporting foundation that shapes our strategy. You won’t just observe the work, you’ll help define how we measure success across the entire function.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you’re excited by analytics, love organizing chaos into clarity, and want your work to influence real business decisions, you will be a great fit for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
